.DS_Store
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Runtime inboxes/outboxes, not repo content (see doctor in twbx_tool.py):
# README tells users to drop workbooks into dummy/, and every run writes
# its result into results/. Ignore what lands in them, not the directories
# themselves - `doctor --fix` (re)creates the directories on a fresh clone.
dummy/*
results/*

# Per-developer Claude Code permission cache - carries whatever absolute
# paths that developer's own session happened to approve.
.claude/settings.local.json

# Working scratch: 38 MB of binary workbooks, not source
tmp/
# Eval iterations after the archived iteration-1. A [2-9] class would stop
# matching at iteration-10, which is exactly when the directory gets big.
evals/iteration-*/
!evals/iteration-1/
evals/iteration-1/eval-*/
